# Dreams vs Realities in Higher Education Humanities Programs: A Critical Moment

**Authors:** Perkins, Hattie

## Abstract
With the conviction that a student needs purpose in life and that the humanities as a discipline can contribute most significantly to this achievement, research to determine the extent of higher education programs in this country was undertaken, with the encouraging conclusion that humanities are offered in some form in all institutions surveyed. (JB)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ066635

